        "narration": "",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 0.1,
            "end": 1.9,
            "text": "You know, I pushed at the beginning.\n一开始，我硬撑着。"
          },
          {
            "at": 2.94,
            "end": 6.2,
            "text": "I thought that I just need to stay very strong, tough,\n我以为只要够坚强、够硬，"
          },
          {
            "at": 6.38,
            "end": 7.4,
            "text": "and just keep practicing.\n一直练下去就行。"
          },
          {
            "at": 8.64,
            "end": 11.9,
            "text": "Yeah, but then I just couldn't get out of bed anymore.\n可后来，我连床都下不来了。"
          },
          {
            "at": 12.9,
            "end": 16.6,
            "text": "I was just lifeless, to be honest.\n说实话，我整个人都没了生气。"
          }
        ],
        "frame": "person",
